  message: "Batch 0 landed + audit filed (2026-07-20, PR #776). The per-value CANONICAL-vs-FOLD verdict pass is filed as docs/audits/0017-endpoint-shape-long-tail.md: all 22 long-tail values FOLD, zero CANONICAL. Batch 0 (script_src) is DONE: it was already producer-migrated (html.py emits references + ref_construct=script_src, INV-vavat), so its dead registry entry was pruned (SCHEMA_VERSION 0.15.0 to 0.16.0; endpoint_shape 22 to 21), discharging the WI-pusuv access_mode-census coupling. 21 folds remain as per-pattern batches (Batches 1-7 in the audit), each its own Phase-3/4b-prime plus bakeoff cycle. Human-ruling decision points flagged in the audit: signal_receiver (event_publishes vs dispatches_to), base_image (depends_on vs extends), notifies_resource (event_publishes vs depends_on), build_tag_alternative_of (FOLD vs borderline-CANONICAL), plus docstring-disagreements on abi_call (call_kind not protocol) and uses_mixin (includes not references). Stays todo_soft as owner of the remaining 21 folds."  # 04c1
- op: discuss  # 17e2
  at: '2026-07-21T02:39:04Z'  # 17e2
  by: agent  # 17e2
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 17e2
  clock: 3  # 17e2
  nonce: '17e2'  # 17e2
  message: "Decision points RULED (2026-07-20). The fold-target ambiguities flagged in audit-findings 0017 (and 0016) were investigated via a 4-lens ADR/spec/spirit/history pass (4 parallel read-only sub-agents) and ruled together with the owner one at a time. All stay FOLD (zero CANONICAL); two provisional targets were REVISED and the audit docs updated (docs-only PR).\n\nFinalized 0017 targets: signal_receiver to dispatches_to + framework_dispatch=django_signal (dispatch shape + dead-code reachability, not pub-sub); notifies_resource to depends_on + ref_construct=puppet_notify + refresh=true (REVISED from the provisional event_publishes; same resource-to-resource shape as sibling requires_resource, avoids a synthetic channel and an async-IO misweight); base_image to depends_on + ref_construct=dockerfile_stage (over extends; sibling COPY --from already emits depends_on); build_tag_alternative_of to references + ref_construct=build_tag_alternative (borderline-CANONICAL declined: lossy single-direction projection + lone Go-only producer below the N=3/N=2 promotion bar; re-eval trigger recorded); abi_call to calls + call_kind=abi (not protocol, closed enum); uses_mixin to includes + ref_construct=sass_mixin.\n\nAlso 0016 (WI-sumik, closed): openapi_implements REVISED to references + ref_construct=openapi_operation (no producer flip; the spec-to-handler direction is deliberate and powers forward-slice-from-spec); resolver_for_type to references. The family folds heterogeneously (2 implements, 2 references).\n\nPer-batch target decisions are now CLOSED. The remaining WI-pumav work is the mechanical per-batch producer migrations (Batches 1-7 in audit-findings 0017), each its own Phase-3/4b cycle with bakeoff validation. Stays todo_soft as owner of the 21 folds."  # 17e2
